rgin><TopMargin>1cm</TopMargin><BottomMargin>1cm</BottomMargin><ColumnSpacing>0.13cm</ColumnSpacing><Style /></Page></ReportSection></ReportSections><ReportParameters><ReportParameter Name="intReportCycle"><DataType>Integer</DataType><Prompt>Report Cycle</Prompt><ValidValues><DataSetReference><DataSetName>Cycles</DataSetName><ValueField>TblReportsManagementCycleID</ValueField><LabelField>txtCycleAndYear</LabelField></DataSetReference></ValidValues></ReportParameter><ReportParameter Name="intReportTypes"><DataType>Integer</DataType><Prompt>Report Types</Prompt><ValidValues><DataSetReference><DataSetName>ReportTypes</DataSetName><ValueField>intType</ValueField><LabelField>txtReportTypeName</LabelField></DataSetReference></ValidValues><MultiValue>true</MultiValue></ReportParameter></ReportParameters><Code>Function SumLookup(ByVal items As Object()) As Decimal  
If items Is Nothing Then  
Return Nothing  
End If  
Dim suma As Decimal = New Decimal()  
Dim ct as Integer = New Integer()  
suma = 0  
ct = 0  
For Each item As Object In items  
suma += Convert.ToDecimal(item)  
ct += 1  
Next  
If (ct = 0) Then return 0 else return suma   
End Function</Code><EmbeddedImages><EmbeddedImage Name="iSAMSLine"><MIMEType>image/png</MIMEType><ImageData></ImageData></EmbeddedImage></EmbeddedImages><rd:ReportUnitType>Cm</rd:ReportUnitType><rd:ReportID>637318d3-eb15-474e-bb2b-18f13d267720</rd:ReportID></Report>